      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHAMPAGNE CRUSADER (2) is building into the campaign, missing by 2.2L last start when flying from the back of the pack. Tsang's claim comes in handy and he can settle a touch closer in the run this time around. Building nicely and looks set to go one better this time around. LUCKY I AM (3) led them up last start and couldn't hold on, beaten 2.7L at this track and trip a fortnight ago. Can take up the running once again this time and if she gets it all her own way up front, she'll be tough to run down. CLEANEMUP (6) disappointed two back but bounced back to form when out to 1300m on the quick turnaround. Chris Parnham hops on board now as she comes back to the midweeks. Can make an impression. DUBAI'S DAUGHTER (7) is fresh off a nice trial behind a handy type coming in. Faithfull hops on board and she won't be far away. UNDER INFLUENCE (1) can improve out to 1200m and can feature in the finish.",
